ClientError.description:
Every refusal: `{"error": "...", "code": "..."}`. The status says the
class, `code` which refusal it is (#3468): an app branches on `code`,
never on `error`'s wording, which is for a person.

oneOf.description:
darkmux could not put the workspace on a `mux/` branch of its own
(a branch of the repo's, such as one named `mux`, is in the way;
422); `error` carries git's reason.
